      "content": "hey so i got this really big red bump on my lower back. its super painful and feels like it's filled with liquid or something under the skin. it's gotten way bigger since yesterday and it's throbbing. i have a sterile needle in my first aid kit... do u think i should just pop it myself to let the pressure out so it heals faster? it looks like it needs to be drained",
